sequenceDiagram
    actor Sales as 销售
    participant Frontend as 前端
    participant API as 合同API
    participant Service as 合同服务
    participant DB as 数据库
    participant FileStorage as 文件存储
    
    Sales ->> Frontend: 创建合同（草稿）
    Frontend ->> API: POST /api/contracts/
    API ->> Service: create_contract(data)
    Service ->> DB: INSERT contracts
    DB -->> Service: 合同ID
    Service -->> API: 合同对象
    API -->> Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend -->> Sales: 显示合同详情页
    
    Sales ->> Frontend: 上传合同PDF
    Frontend ->> API: POST /api/contracts/{id}/upload (multipart/form-data)
    API ->> Service: save_file(file)
    Service ->> FileStorage: 保存到 uploads/contracts/
    FileStorage -->> Service: 文件路径
    Service ->> DB: UPDATE contracts SET file_path
    API -->> Frontend: 200 OK
    
    Sales ->> Frontend: 提交审批（待签署）
    Frontend ->> API: POST /api/contracts/{id}/change-status
    API ->> Service: change_status(id, "pending_signature")
    Service ->> DB: UPDATE contracts SET status
    API -->> Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend -->> Sales: 显示"待签署"状态

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as APScheduler
    participant Task as 定时任务
    participant Service as 公海池服务
    participant DB as 数据库
    participant Wecom as 企微通知
    
    Scheduler ->> Task: 每天凌晨2点触发
    Task ->> Service: check_and_return_leads()
    Service ->> DB: SELECT leads WHERE status='assigned' AND assigned_at < (now() - return_days)
    DB -->> Service: 超时线索列表
    
    alt 有超时线索
        loop 每个超时线索
            Service ->> DB: UPDATE leads SET status='returned_to_pool', assigned_to=NULL
            Service ->> Wecom: 发送通知给当事人（销售）
            Note over Wecom: 只通知销售本人，不通知管理员
        end
        Service -->> Task: 回流计数
    end
    
    Task -->> Scheduler: 任务完成

---

sequenceDiagram
    actor Sales as 销售
    participant Frontend as 前端
    participant API as 周报API
    participant Service as 周报服务
    participant AIService as AI生成服务
    participant DB as 数据库
    
    Sales ->> Frontend: 点击"AI生成周报草稿"
    Frontend ->> API: POST /api/weekly-reports/generate-draft
    API ->> Service: generate_draft(user_id, week, year)
    Service ->> AIService: generate_by_rules(user_id, week, year)
    
    Note over AIService: Phase 1: 规则模板生成
    AIService ->> DB: 查询本周跟进记录
    AIService ->> DB: 查询本周商机进展
    AIService -->> Service: 生成的周报内容（Markdown）
    
    Service ->> DB: INSERT weekly_reports (ai_generated=true)
    DB -->> Service: 周报ID
    Service -->> API: 周报对象
    API -->> Frontend: 200 OK (周报草稿)
    Frontend -->> Sales: 显示周报编辑页（可人工修改）
